      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but it feels like such a cliché response. like, \"it gets better\" or whatever. i'm trying to write something about how this emptiness isn't just a phase, but like... the truth. how everything beautiful eventually has to just stop to be meaningful. do you get what i mean? like part of me thinks the only way to actually reach that truth is to stop fighting it.",
